<metadata xml:lang="en"><Esri><CreaDate>20250406</CreaDate><CreaTime>11215100</CreaTime><ArcGISFormat>1.0</ArcGISFormat><SyncOnce>TRUE</SyncOnce><ModDate>20250421</ModDate><ModTime>16301400</ModTime><scaleRange><minScale>150000000</minScale><maxScale>5000</maxScale></scaleRange><ArcGISProfile>ItemDescription</ArcGISProfile></Esri><tool name="Sen2CubeTool" displayname="Sen2Cube Inference" toolboxalias="Sen2Cube" xmlns=""><arcToolboxHelpPath>c:\users\chris\appdata\local\programs\arcgis\pro\Resources\Help\gp</arcToolboxHelpPath><parameters><param name="user_name" displayname="Username" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="String" expression="user_name"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Enter your &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A href="https://demo.sen2cube.at/app" target="_blank" STYLE="text-decoration:underline;"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Sen2Cube&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;.at &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;account username&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="password" displayname="Password" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="String Hidden" expression="password"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Enter your &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;A href="https://demo.sen2cube.at/app" target="_blank" STYLE="text-decoration:underline;"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Sen2Cube&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;.at&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt; account password&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="login_button" displayname="Login to sen2cube" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="Boolean" expression="{login_button}"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;The entered username and password will be authenticated.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="available_facebases" displayname="Currently Available Factbase" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="String" expression="available_facebases"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;The dropdown list contains a list of all currently available factbases. If a factbase does not appear in this list, it is either busy or offline. Please select one of the available factbases to contin&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;u&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;e.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="knowledgebase" displayname="Knowledgebase" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="String" expression="knowledgebase"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;This dropdown list contains a list of all the knowledgebase models saved to your Sen2cube.at account.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="aoi" displayname="Set the Area of Interest" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="Extent" expression="aoi"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Set the Area of Interest (AOI). &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="start_date" displayname="Start Date" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="Date" expression="start_date"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Set the start date for the inference.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="end_date" displayname="End Date" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="Date" expression="end_date"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Set the end date for the inference.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="comment" displayname="Add a comment to the inference" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="String" expression="{comment}"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Add a comment. The comment will be attached to your infrence in your online Sen2cube.at account.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="favourite" displayname="Save inference as favourite in sen2cube account" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="Boolean" expression="{favourite}"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Save this inference as a favorite in your online Sen2cube account.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="quick_preview" displayname="Quick Preview (Downsamples factbase resolution)" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="Boolean" expression="{quick_preview}"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Use this option to downsample the factbase resolution. The result will be coarser by a factor of 10, but the result will load faster.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="out_dir" displayname="Output Directory" type="Required" direction="Input" datatype="Folder" expression="out_dir"><dialogReference>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Select a local folder where the loaded inference (.tiff) will be stored. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</dialogReference></param><param name="hidden_login_err_msg" displayname="Login Monitoring" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="String" expression="{hidden_login_err_msg}"/><param name="inactivity_reset" displayname="Inactivity Reset" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="Boolean" expression="{inactivity_reset}"/><param name="just_reset" displayname="Just Reset" type="Optional" direction="Input" datatype="Boolean" expression="{just_reset}"/></parameters><summary>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;The Sen2Cube.at toolbox is an ArcGIS Pro interface for the Sen2Cube.at platform.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;It allows users to:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;UL&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Authenticate with the Sen2Cube.at backend directly inside ArcGIS Pro,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Query and select available factbases (Earth observation data stores),&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Select and configure knowledgebase models for inference tasks,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Specify an area of interest (AOI) and a time period,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Submit inference jobs to the Sen2Cube.at system,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Monitor processing status,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Automatically download and add results into the active ArcGIS Pro project.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Key elements of the toolbox include token auto-refreshing, inactivity monitoring and auto-logout, dynamic parameter updates, and user guidance with error messages during the whole process.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</summary><usage>&lt;DIV STYLE="text-align:Left;"&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;DIV&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;A href="https://github.com/Christina1281995/arcpy_toolbox_sen2cube/wiki/User-Guide" target="_blank" STYLE="text-decoration:underline;"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;View a step by step user guide here &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;https://github.com/Christina1281995/arcpy_toolbox_sen2cube/wiki/User-Guide&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;</usage></tool><dataIdInfo><idCitation><resTitle>Sen2Cube.at Inferences</resTitle></idCitation><searchKeys><keyword>EO</keyword><keyword>Earth Observation</keyword><keyword>Sen2Cube</keyword><keyword>sentinel</keyword><keyword>bigEOdata</keyword></searchKeys></dataIdInfo><distInfo><distributor><distorFormat><formatName>ArcToolbox Tool</formatName></distorFormat></distributor></distInfo><mdHrLv><ScopeCd value="005"/></mdHrLv><mdDateSt Sync="TRUE">20250421</mdDateSt></metadata>
